NOTICE ABOUT THE CONTENT

This repository is a frozen and intentionally incomplete snapshot. The
production prompts of the content generator, the implementations of the five
social-network integrations, their API error diagnosis table and all
credentials have been omitted or replaced with stubs. The code is NOT
deployable and does NOT represent the production system.

